            # run-proven `lower_for_dict` k/v-iteration machinery (the same
            # philosophy as the Vector HOF intercept above and `lower_vector_fold`).
            # Gated on the TYPED receiver kind (collection_kind_of → CkDict, no
            # name matching). Returns -1 (fall through to the normal extern
