            # (b) the per-arg owning-promotion inside the loop — previously two
            # separate `collection_builtin_method(_recv_ck, mname)` matches, now
            # one linear-scan + clone hoisted out (correctness-neutral, cheaper).
            Option[BuiltinMethodDecl] _mut_decl = collection_builtin_method(_recv_ck, mname)
            # Collection-mutator owning-VALUE-arg expected type. A bare `None`
            # (and `Some`/`Ok`/`Error`) pushed into a `Vector[Option[T]]` /
